# 🎯 HYPERLIQUID BOT - ONE-PAGE QUICK REFERENCE

## SETUP PATH (Choose One)

### 🔷 LAPTOP (Testing)
```
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env        # Edit with your API keys
python3 hyperliquid_trading_bot.py
```
**Best for:** Learning, testnet validation, day trading

### 🌐 VPS (24/7 Recommended) - 15 MIN SETUP
```
1. Create DigitalOcean account (digitalocean.com)
2. Create $5/month Ubuntu 22.04 droplet
3. SSH: ssh root@YOUR_IP
4. Upload files (scp command)
5. nano .env       # Configure API keys
6. pip install -r requirements.txt
7. screen -S hyperliquid -d -m python3 hyperliquid_trading_bot.py
8. Done! Bot runs 24/7
```
**Best for:** Automated trading while you sleep

