## .ENV CONFIGURATION (What You Need To Fill In)

```env
# YOUR HYPERLIQUID CREDENTIALS (Get from https://app.hyperliquid.xyz/API)
HYPERLIQUID_ACCOUNT=0xyour_wallet_address_here
HYPERLIQUID_PRIVATE_KEY=your_private_key_here

# TRADING PARAMETERS
ACCOUNT_SIZE=10000                    # Start small
MAX_LOSS_PER_TRADE=0.02              # 2% max loss
MAX_LEVERAGE=3                       # 1x=no leverage, 3x=3x leverage
SYMBOLS=BTC,ETH                      # What to trade
TIMEFRAME_MINUTES=5                  # 1=scalp, 5=day, 60=swing
CYCLE_INTERVAL=60                    # Check every 60 seconds

# SAFETY FLAGS
BACKTEST_MODE=true                   # ← Start HERE (no real trades)
# Change to false when ready for real money

# ADVANCED (Optional)
MIN_CONFIRMATION_COUNT=3             # Need 3+ TA signals aligned
MIN_RISK_REWARD_RATIO=1.5            # Minimum reward/risk
```

