## BOT LOGIC (How It Works)

```
Every 60 seconds:

1. CHECK MACRO (Is environment favorable?)
   ├─ Fed expanding or contracting?
   ├─ Stablecoins flowing in/out?
   ├─ Funding rates reasonable?
   └─ Whales accumulating or distributing?

2. ANALYZE TA (Are signals aligned?)
   ├─ RSI oversold/overbought?
   ├─ MACD bullish/bearish cross?
   ├─ Uptrend/downtrend structure?
   ├─ Bollinger Bands squeezed?
   └─ Order flow bullish/bearish?

3. COUNT CONFIRMATIONS
   └─ If 3+ signals aligned → Generate signal
   └─ If <3 signals → Skip trade (wait for better setup)

4. VALIDATE RISK
   ├─ Risk/Reward ≥ 1.5:1?
   ├─ Position size OK?
   └─ Leverage appropriate?

5. EXECUTE
   └─ Place order on Hyperliquid
   └─ Set stop-loss & take-profit
   └─ Log everything
```

