## QUICK COMMANDS (Copy/Paste)

### Start Bot (Laptop)
```bash
python3 hyperliquid_trading_bot.py
```

### Start Bot (VPS - Background)
```bash
screen -S hyperliquid -d -m python3 hyperliquid_trading_bot.py
```

### Check Bot Output
```bash
tail -50 hyperliquid_bot.log      # Last 50 lines
tail -f hyperliquid_bot.log       # Live (Ctrl+C to stop)
```

### Stop Bot
```bash
pkill -f hyperliquid_trading_bot  # Kill process
```

### Restart Bot
```bash
pkill -f hyperliquid_trading_bot && sleep 2 && python3 hyperliquid_trading_bot.py &
```

### Check if Running
```bash
ps aux | grep python
```

