## TROUBLESHOOTING DECISION TREE

```
Bot not running?
├─ Error message? → Check Python version (need 3.9+)
├─ API key issue? → Regenerate on Hyperliquid
└─ File missing? → Upload all files again

Bot running but not trading?
├─ Wrong BACKTEST_MODE? → Set to false for real trades
├─ Macro too bearish? → Lower MIN_CONFIRMATION_COUNT
├─ Low win rate (<55%)? → Raise MIN_CONFIRMATION_COUNT to 4
└─ Too much slippage? → Use LIMIT orders, not market

Bot losing money?
├─ Analyze last 10 trades → What went wrong?
├─ Check macro alignment → Were conditions favorable?
├─ Check confirmations → Were they legit?
└─ Reduce leverage → Try 1.0x instead of 3.0x

VPS connection lost?
└─ Bot keeps running! Just SSH back in and check logs
```

